            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Tay Ho",
            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nTasty Local Treats\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThe Mixed Egg & Pork Steam Rice-Paper Rolls (Bánh Cuốn trứng nhân thịt) were delicious and savory. The pork filling was well-seasoned and tender, while the fried shallots added plenty of flavour and aroma. I also tried the Bean Cake (Bánh đậu), which had a crumbly texture without being dry, and a smooth bean filling. Lastly, I had the Tây Hồ doughnut. While it wasn't greasy and the filling had just the right amount of sweetness, the exterior was quite hard to bite into.\nThe sellers were really warm and friendly.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 26, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
