            "review_text": "Jimmy D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nOverpriced for the quality\nAug 2020\nI remember having a not-so-special experience with this franchise in my first visit. Nonetheless, I decided to give it another try today. I indeed remember correctly. The Banh Cuon came out cold and didn't taste that great. It was 50k VND alone for that and you had to pay extra for the other dishes. Then, after going through another bad episode of Banh Cuon Tay Ho, the guard asked for bike money, too. Really?!? Never going back\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 22, 2020",
