            "review_text": "Grantman66\nPortland, Oregon2002 contributions\n0\nYoung travelers delight\nMar 2019 • Family\nMy daughter and I spent a week in Viet Nam recently and she worked hard to find local food. Most of what we found, which was awesome, will not be listed in TA which is unfortunate. What we did find at Tay Ho was very good, fresh and local cuisine. Staff was good, food was timely and as I've found in most local restaurants it was quite clean. The restaurant takes a little looking for if you're on foot as we were but it's well marked. Well worth the visit if you're looking for some mild adventure in Saigon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 3, 2019",
